silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_03_dependency_and_mittens_legs_concrete_anchor_5#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Dependencies and \\(\\Mittens\\) Source Legs' the bare symbol Mittens anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
